OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying dry
OL,6,Fwith clear spells this evening.
OL,7,FTurning cloudier overnight with some
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain and drizzle moving
OL,9,Fsoutheastwards by dawn. A mild and
OL,10,Fperhaps rather humid night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FAny lingering rain quickly
OL,13,Fclearing, with bright or sunny spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping throughout the morning.
OL,15,FTurning cloudier with rain arriving by
OL,16,Fthe evening. Feeling fresher with
OL,17,Ftemperatures nearer to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
