OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FEarly
OL,6,Frain clearing then largely dry on
OL,7,FTuesday. Mostly fine and dry on
OL,8,FWednesday and Thursday, although
OL,9,Fpatchy rain may arrive late Thursday.
OL,10,FTemperatures perhaps a little below
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
